<Site title="Website Terms | Lifeline Development Trust" description="Read the website terms for Lifeline Development Trust, including the distinction between charitable objectives, confirmed activities and donation enquiries."><main class="wrap section prose"><p class="eyebrow">WEBSITE INFORMATION</p><h1>Website terms</h1><h2>Purpose of this website</h2><p>This website introduces Lifeline Development Trust, its stated charitable objectives and ways to contact the organization. Objectives are not evidence of completed programs. Stock photographs are illustrative, not records of Trust activities.</p><h2>Enquiries, volunteering and donations</h2><p>Submitting an enquiry does not confirm a volunteer placement, partnership or contribution. This website does not process payments. Obtain and verify the Trust’s current contribution instructions directly before sending funds.</p><h2>No unsupported claims</h2><p>No registration number, certification, tax exemption, financial result or beneficiary achievement is claimed unless supported by verified information published by the Trust.</p><h2>Images and content</h2><p>Organization-supplied images remain attributable to their respective owners. Illustrative photographs are provided through Pexels. Do not imply that a person shown is a Trust beneficiary or representative without confirmation.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>Please <a class="text-link" href="/contact">contact the Trust</a> about the content of this website or any proposed involvement.</p></main></Site>